241
00:16:50.427 --> 00:16:52.554
{\an8}<i>Berdasarkan analisis perusahaan saya,</i>

242
00:16:52.637 --> 00:16:55.306
{\an8}<i>kami mencapai kesepakatan bahwa</i>
<i>ketika proyek ini selesai,</i>

243
00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:59.769
<i>keuntungan minimal 30 triliun won</i>
